store-heretic-path-moon = Path of Moon

knowledge-path-moon-s1-name = Moonlight Troupe
knowledge-path-moon-s1-desc =
    Under the light of the moon the laughter echoes.
    
    Opens the Path of Moon to you.
    Allows you to transmute two sheets of glass and a knife into a Lunar Blade.
    You can only create two at a time.
    Your Mansus Grasp damages the sanity of its victim and makes them hallucinate.
knowledge-path-moon-s2-name = Grasp of Moon
knowledge-path-moon-s2-desc =
    The laughter grew louder, and no one could tell where it came from.
    
    Your Mansus Grasp damages the sanity of its victim, makes them hallucinate and forces them to laugh.
    Your brain now regenerates on its own, and sleep can no longer take you.
    You can no longer develop brain traumas, and your Grasp briefly conceals your identity.
knowledge-path-moon-s3-name = Mind Gate
knowledge-path-moon-s3-desc =
    My mind swings open like a gate, and its insight will let me perceive the truth.
    
    Grants you Mind Gate, a spell which mutes, deafens and blinds its target, inflicts hallucinations
    and confusion, and damages their brain. The victim starts laughing, and the laughter of the troupe
    echoes around them. Casting it also harms your own mind.
knowledge-path-moon-s4-name = Mark of Moon
knowledge-path-moon-s4-desc =
    His wit was sharp as a blade, cutting through the lie to bring us joy.
    
    Your Mansus Grasp now applies the Mark of Moon.
    The mark detonates when struck with the Lunar Blade, damaging the mind of its victim and confusing them.
knowledge-path-moon-s5-name = Lunar Parade
knowledge-path-moon-s5-desc =
    The music, like a reflection of the soul, compelled them, and like moths to a flame they followed.
    
    Grants you Lunar Parade, a spell which sends a carnival projectile forward.
    Anyone pierced by it joins the parade, suffering hallucinations and brain damage.
knowledge-path-moon-s6-name = Moonlight Amulet
knowledge-path-moon-s6-desc =
    At the head of the parade he stood, the moon condensed into one mass, a reflection of the soul.
    
    Allows you to transmute two sheets of glass, a heart and a piece of cloth into the Moonlight Amulet.
    Hold the amulet in your hand and use it on a maddened crew member to turn them into an allied lunatic.
    Heretics of the Path of Moon can convert them even before ascension.
knowledge-path-moon-s7-name = Moonlight Blade
knowledge-path-moon-s7-desc =
    His wit was sharp as a blade...
    
    Your Lunar Blade now deals brain damage, causes random hallucinations and damages sanity.
    It deals more brain damage to insane or unconscious victims.
knowledge-path-moon-s8-name = Ringleaders Rise
knowledge-path-moon-s8-desc =
    I grabbed his hand and we rose, those who saw the truth rose with us.
    
    Grants you Ringleaders Rise, a spell which summons illusory copies of you.
    The copies attack nearby targets. You can have one active copy before ascension, or three afterwards.
knowledge-path-moon-s9-name = The Last Act
knowledge-path-moon-s9-desc =
    The ascension ritual of the Path of Moon.
    Bring 3 corpses with more than half of their brain damaged to a transmutation rune to complete the ritual.
    Upon completion you become a harbinger of madness, gaining an aura of passive sanity decay
    that from time to time turns part of the crew into lunatics - maddened allies.
    Victims of the aura hear distant laughter and laugh themselves.

heretic-ascension-moon =
    The laughter I have heard all my life finally had a face. It was mine.
    The troupe stepped out from behind the curtains, and the hall held its breath.
    I raised my hand, and the moon smiled back. WITNESS MY ASCENSION!

heretic-ritual-fail-sacrifice-moon = At least three corpses must have more than half of their brain damaged!

moon-regalia-head-explode = {$ent}'s head splatters with a sickening crunch!
moon-amulet-conversion-failed = The amulet does not respond.
moon-amulet-not-mad = The victim has not lost their mind yet.
moon-amulet-limit = The moon has already claimed two.

heretic-speech-moon-mind-gate = OP'N Y'R M'ND!
heretic-speech-moon-parade = L'N'R P'R'D!
heretic-speech-moon-ringleader = R'S' 'ND SH'NE!

roles-antag-moon-lunatic-name = Lunatic
roles-antag-moon-lunatic-description = The moon has revealed the truth to you. Aid the ascended heretic of the Moon and spread madness.
role-subtype-moon-lunatic = Lunatic
moon-lunatic-roundend-name = a lunatic

moon-lunatic-welcome =
    The laughter of the moon fills your head, and now it has a face - { CAPITALIZE(THE($ent)) }.
    Obey the ascended heretic and spread madness alongside them.
moon-lunatic-briefing =
    The moon has revealed the truth to you: { CAPITALIZE(THE($ent)) } leads you now.
    Obey the ascended heretic and spread madness alongside them.
moon-lunatic-briefing-noname =
    The moon has revealed the truth to you.
    Obey the ascended heretic and spread madness alongside them.

